      "description": "THREE.js is an open source javascript library for 3D graphics on the web. In this lesson we walk through the process of loading an external gltf model from blender into THREE.js version 100.\n\nNote: Due to browser security restrictions loading of files will not work on your local file system, so you will need to run the demos on a server for it to load the file.\n\nVersion 100 of THREE.js was used for the making of this video.\n\nDocumentation on Loading 3D Models:\nhttps://threejs.org/docs/#manual/en/introduction/Loading-3D-models\n\nDownload the demo files here:\nhttps://github.com/diving-in/threejs/blob/master/threejs-7b_models.zip",
